     "text_raw": "Once all four pieces are attached together, square the frame by measuring the two diagonals and making adjustments until they are equal. Then, brace the frame by screwing a diagonal piece onto the back as shown. '''Double-check your diagonals and make sure that the frame did not come out of square as you braced it.'''",
